{
  "note": "Draft capture records for the trails of the split ca that have a trailhead point (Sentier La Chute and the Marble Mountain and Mont Saddle loop), with their trailhead records. The trails' suitability and relevance records are committed in data/suitability/catalogue/R9-ca.json and data/relevance/catalogue/R9-ca.json. The capture records are withheld from data/capture/catalogue/ because a trail's required tier asks for a stored OSM track (geometry) and web/scripts/tracks-osm.mjs only builds tracks for places of the web snapshot, so each would be a new W_TIER_REQUIRED error. Move them into BA-ca.json (and the trailhead relevance records into R9-ca.json) when catalogue trails can get a track. No trailhead point was found for La Crete, L'Eperon, Sentier des Cimes and Mont du Dome (Overpass was at capacity), so they have no draft capture record. Built from the same source tables as the committed lane files.",
